<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 25.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 25.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 25		July 24</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.672		  4.464</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  23.182		 23.733</p>
<p>Cash balance		  27.853		 28.197</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit	5,283.008	     5,282.231</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $423 million were issued and $39 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
